		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Cursed spirit of a murdered sailor given an improper burial. Misty, hazy figure with a foggy cloud instead of legs.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 18, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +4 (1d8 + <strong>S</strong>TR drain), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Last Rites</strong>. Destroyed by bless spell, holy water, or being given last rites. STR Drain. CON 15+ or lose 1d4 STR permanently. Death if reduced to 0 STR. Duppy regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
